@startuml "Traitement des webhooks"

title Traitement des webhooks Stripe

participant "Payment Gateway\n(Stripe)" as Stripe
participant "API Gateway\n(Next.js API)" as API
participant "Message Queue\n(Bull/Redis)" as Queue
participant "Business Services" as Services
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Stripe -> API: POST /api/webhook/stripe
API -> API: Verify webhook signature
API -> Queue: addJob('process_webhook', {event})
API --> Stripe: 200 OK (immediate response)

Queue -> Services: processStripeWebhook(event)
Services -> DB: Update payment status
Services -> Queue: addJob('post_payment_actions', {paymentId})

@enduml